; CBOR Tags for IPv4 and IPv6 Addresses and Prefixes (RFC 9164)
; The CDDL of the RFC, as extracted by cddlc (https://github.com/cabo/cddlc, data/rfc9164.cddl).
; Copyright (c) 2021 IETF Trust and the persons identified as the authors of the code. All rights reserved.
; Code Components extracted from this document must include Revised BSD License text as
